  * Verify runtime PnL endpoints
  * Docs updated

## Definition of done

  * Code written
  * PnL service added
  * Mark storage added
  * API added
  * Tests added
  * Runtime path verified
  * Failure case checked
  * Output verified
  * Docs updated
"""
    text = text.rstrip() + addition + "\n"
    path.write_text(text)
